  "schema_version": 1,
  "name": "replay-backfilled-day-goes-stale",
  "description": "a backfilled day, dated before its stream first sent anything, is imported history and carries no arrival, so each reading ages from its timestamp and the hour-long gap reads stale: under met the stale gap fires, under not_met it ends the excursion and the low after it opens a new one, under hold the excursion is held across it",
